OL,3,GNEWSAFamily who died in sea were
OL,4,A'familiar with water'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family who died in the sea off
OL,7,FShoreham were familiar with the water
OL,8,Fand the father was considered a strong
OL,9,Fswimmer, a community spokesman has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FHassan El-Khawas, 55, Zeina Alayn, 37,
OL,13,Fand their daughter Sara, 14, died after
OL,14,Fgetting into difficulty in the water
OL,15,Fnear Shoreham Fort, on 18 August. Saja,
OL,16,Fsix, died in hospital on Friday.
OL,18,FMohamad Fadi, from the Palestinian
OL,19,FForum in Britain (PFB), said the family
OL,20,Foriginated from Rashidieh refugee camp
OL,21,Fin southern Lebanon, which is on the
OL,22,FMediterranean coast.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
