OL,3,GNEWSAFamily who died in sea were
OL,4,A'familiar with water'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said they would have been familiar
OL,7,Fwith the sea and able to "assess their
OL,8,Fsituation". Sussex Police has said the
OL,9,Fdeaths are being treated as a tragic
OL,10,Faccident.
